    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1/4 cup avocado oil",
    "1/2 cup grated parmesan cheese"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure and prepare all the ingredients. Preheat oven to 350F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-asparagus-walnut-salad/#wprm-recipe-53621-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Asparagus-and-Walnut-Salad-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper. Put the chopped walnuts on the baking sheet. Bake for about 10 minutes or until they are a light golden brown in color.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-asparagus-walnut-salad/#wprm-recipe-53621-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Asparagus-and-Walnut-Salad-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash the asparagus spears and cut off the fibrous ends (discard the fibrous parts). Then, thinly slice the asparagus spears at an angle.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-asparagus-walnut-salad/#wprm-recipe-53621-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Asparagus-and-Walnut-Salad-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, combine the lemon juice, lemon zest, chili-garlic paste, salt, and avocado oil.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-asparagus-walnut-salad/#wprm-recipe-53621-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Asparagus-and-Walnut-Salad-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the grated parmesan cheese and stir well until combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-asparagus-walnut-salad/#wprm-recipe-53621-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Asparagus-and-Walnut-Salad-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plate the cut asparagus spears and the toasted walnuts.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-asparagus-walnut-salad/#wprm-recipe-53621-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Asparagus-and-Walnut-Salad-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with the dressing, toss lightly, and serve. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-asparagus-walnut-salad/#wprm-recipe-53621-step-0-6",
